                  "text": "Kal 35:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "’Diyi aku ovupi opezaru i Israeli anzipi yi dri dria, ani’ba ovupi ’yi ma eselea ’diyi dri indi, ’ba dria alu alu i agyini fupi aka kuri ma ovu fuzaru ’ba lepi avu arioti ofepiri dri ku, kpere erini pa soria ’ba ongulu­muru drilia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
